('GSI25M05-009', '2025-05', 'Mubadala', 'Mubadala Capital', 'CI Financial take-private status May 2025', 'Canada', 'GULF_OUTBOUND_SECONDARY', 'PRIOR_ACQUISITION_PENDING_CLOSING', 'PENDING_MAY_CLOSED_AUG_12_2025', 'LEDGER_ONLY_PRIOR_PENDING', '', 'CAD', 'CAD12100M_TOTAL_TRANSACTION_NOT_MAY_CASH', '2025-05-31', 'https://www.cifinancial.com/ci-financial/ca/en/newsroom/ci-financial-and-mubadala-capital-announce-completion-of-take--private-transaction-by-mubadala-capital.html', '', 'CI Financial take-private signed November 2024; closed August 12, 2025, not May. Later reported investor cash CAD4.599bn (not entire enterprise valuation).', 'Update November record with August 2025 closing and investor cash amount.', 'GSI24N11-005', '', 'v9.6'),
('GSI25J01-005', '2025-01', 'ADIA', 'Platinum Lily B 2024 RSC Limited (wholly owned ADIA subsidiary)', 'Yinson Production Offshore USD 1bn RCPS + 10% warrants (closing reported June 2025)', 'United Kingdom (holding company); assets multi-regional, not verified', 'GULF_OUTBOUND_PRIMARY_GROWTH_EQUITY', 'PRIVATE_FUNDING_ROUND_PREFERRED_SHARES_AND_WARRANTS', 'COMPLETED_CLOSING_REPORTED_2025_06_17_FIRST_TRANCHE_USD300M_FUNDED', 'RETAIN_PROVISIONAL_TRANSACTION', '', '', 'ADIA amount not disclosed. USD 1bn is the round headline. RRJ expected USD 320m is another investor', '2025-01-14', 'https://www.yinson-production.com/news/yinson-production-secures-usd-1-billion-investment-from-consortium-of-international-investment-firms-to-drive-further-growth/', 'https://www.oedigital.com/news/526947-yinson-production-closes-1b-investment-to-drive-further-growth', 'Backfill approved by founder 14 Nov 2026 and loaded as a new versioned row; v9.5 unchanged. Company release read in full (14 Jan 2025): consortium of ADIA subsidiary, BCI funds and RRJ; USD 1bn RCPS at USD 3.7bn post-money, optional further USD 500m. Closing article 17 Jun 2025: USD 300m first tranche, USD 700m called in up to 3 instalments by Dec 2026. ADIA-specific amount not disclosed; USD 1bn is the round. No Yinson row found in v9.5 master: one record, announcement and completion together, belongs in Jan 2025. RE-CHECKED 14 Nov 2026: OE Digital closing article read: definitive agreement signed 14 Jan 2025, closing reported 17 Jun 2025, USD 300m first tranche (USD 200m of it a special distribution to Yinson), USD 700m in up to three instalments by Dec 2026, optional further USD 500m within 24 months. Investors named: a wholly owned ADIA subsidiary (not named in that article), BCI funds and RRJ. ADIA amount and stake NOT disclosed. Master v9.5 has no Yinson record. Filing in January at signing is consistent with the ruling. FOUNDER DECISION 14 Nov 2026: approved as a Jan 2025 backfill. Awaiting load into the database by the founder; not loaded.', 'Confirm no Jan 2025 row under another name; if none, propose Jan 2025 backfill with completion 2025-06; find exact closing date', '', '2025-06 (on or before 2025-06-17; exact date not found)', 'v9.6'),
('GSI25A04-006', '2025-04', 'Mubadala', 'Mubadala Energy', '24.1% of Kimmeridge SoTex HoldCo (now Caturus): Eagle Ford gas and Commonwealth LNG', 'United States', 'OUTBOUND_GULF_TO_NORTH_AMERICA', 'MINORITY_EQUITY_NEW_ISSUANCE', 'COMPLETED_2025_08_08_AFTER_CFIUS', 'RETAIN_PROVISIONAL_TRANSACTION', '', '', 'Deal value not disclosed', '2025-04-10', 'https://mubadalaenergy.com/news/mubadala-energy-closes-strategic-investment-in-u-s-natural-gas-and-lng-sector-with-kimmeridge/ (fetch failed on certificate; not read)', 'https://worldoil.com/news/2025/4/10/mubadala-energy-buys-24-stake-in-kimmeridge-marking-its-first-major-u-s-lng-investment/', 'Backfill approved by founder 14 Nov 2026 and loaded as a new versioned row; v9.5 unchanged. World Oil and others report agreement on 10 Apr 2025 for 24.1% via new equity. The National (8 Aug 2025) reports closing. Master has no Kimmeridge or Caturus row (checked 2026-11-13). April 2025 is inside the completed window, so this is a backfill RE-CHECKED 14 Nov 2026: closing on 8 Aug 2025 after CFIUS clearance and the 24.1% stake confirmed by search listings of WAM, The National, MEES and Gulf Business, with two Mubadala Energy board appointees; SoTex HoldCo rebranded Caturus (Commonwealth LNG plus Eagle Ford gas). WAM page returned no text and the Mubadala Energy release was not opened. Deal value not disclosed. Master v9.5 has no Kimmeridge or Caturus record. April 2025 check of other missed rows: one broad search found nothing dated April 2025. FOUNDER DECISION 14 Nov 2026: approved as an Apr 2025 backfill. Awaiting load into the database by the founder; not loaded.', 'Read Mubadala Energy release by another route; confirm 2025-08-08 closing; check April 2025 screen for other missed rows', '', '', 'v9.6')
